{"ref":"BDB, זְקֻנִים","hw":"זְקֻנִים","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זְקֻנִים</span></big>  <strong>n.pl.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>old age</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:3\" href=\"/Genesis.37.3\">Gn 37:3</a> i.e. a late-born son; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶלֶד ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:20\" href=\"/Genesis.44.20\">Gn 44:20</a> <em>id.;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ילדה)בֵּן לִזְקֻנָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:2\" href=\"/Genesis.21.2\">Gn 21:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:7\" href=\"/Genesis.21.7\">7</a> (all JE).","next":"BDB, זָקַף","prev":"BDB, זִקְנָה"}